                                                                                   "https://www.uniprot.org" ;
                                                  rdfs:comment "Built 2026-11-23 from Cao et al. 2015 PMID:26402607 (mouse) with the ELFN1-CACNA2D4 link from Wang et al. 2017 PMID:28262416. Human model; all facts ECO:0000250 (ISS) GO_REF:0000024 with the mouse orthologs. Companion to the rod model gomodel:6ab067da00012590."^^xsd:string ,
                                                               "Curated with GO AI HUB. ELFN1 in the rod terminal binds GRM6 on the ON-bipolar dendrite in trans and is required for the primary rod pathway; built from Cao et al. 2015 PMID:26402607 with the CACNA2D4 link from Wang et al. 2017 PMID:28262416."^^xsd:string ;
